WEBVTT

00:04.080 --> 00:05.710
<b>No need to worry.</b>

00:06.000 --> 00:07.920
<b>Sorry for the late introduction.</b>

00:07.920 --> 00:11.460
<b>This here is our newest 
Hoshimori squad member.</b>

00:12.460 --> 00:13.630
<b>I'm Misaki.</b>

00:14.130 --> 00:15.130
<b>Salutations.</b>

00:15.750 --> 00:18.130
<b>Misaki... is it?</b>

00:18.130 --> 00:20.710
<b>Are you hurt, you two?</b>

00:20.710 --> 00:21.540
<b>No...</b>

00:26.130 --> 00:27.130
<b>Hold up there you!</b>

00:27.130 --> 00:27.420
<b>That girl...</b>

00:27.420 --> 00:28.250
<b>That girl...
This area is off limits.</b>

00:28.250 --> 00:29.500
<b>This area is off limits.</b>

00:29.500 --> 00:31.080
<b>Everything is fine.</b>

00:31.420 --> 00:33.830
<b>I am the one who allowed her in here.</b>

00:34.000 --> 00:34.830
<b>What?</b>

00:34.830 --> 00:36.080
<b>You did...?</b>

00:36.080 --> 00:37.630
<b>But why?</b>

00:37.920 --> 00:41.670
<b>I believe she has what it takes to be
a member of the Hoshimori team.</b>

00:47.540 --> 00:49.880
<b>I am sure you all realized as much just now,</b>

00:49.880 --> 00:53.170
<b>but she is clearly levels 
beyond the rest of you.</b>

00:53.830 --> 00:55.580
<b>Which only leads me to believe...</b>

00:56.000 --> 00:58.580
<b>The whole squad is due for full retraining.</b>

00:59.920 --> 01:01.670
<b>Still though.</b>

01:01.670 --> 01:05.250
<b>A retreat at school? Really?</b>

01:05.250 --> 01:11.130
<b>Oh? I for one am just thrilled to spend
night after night with all those cuties.</b>

01:11.130 --> 01:13.130
<b>Just THRILLED!</b>

01:13.130 --> 01:15.880
<b>Enough. This isn't a vacation, you know.</b>

01:16.170 --> 01:18.630
<b>Yeah yeah, I know.</b>

01:19.330 --> 01:22.330
<b>Ooo, but get a look at this place!</b>

01:22.670 --> 01:27.080
<b>Oh wowie! We could even play 
catch with all this space!</b>

01:27.290 --> 01:30.580
<b>Now now, keep that up and 
you'll be in trouble again.</b>

01:31.040 --> 01:32.880
<b>Oh my!</b>

01:32.880 --> 01:36.000
<b>Is this really our room?</b>

01:36.000 --> 01:39.380
<b>It's not even as big as my kitchen
back home, but I guess it'll do.</b>

01:39.380 --> 01:41.750
<b>I call dibs on this bed!</b>

01:42.710 --> 01:43.580
<b>And then...</b>

01:43.580 --> 01:45.380
<b>this bed here is for Sherry!</b>

01:45.380 --> 01:48.170
<b>And that leaves room for 
me to sleep where, exactly?</b>

01:53.540 --> 01:55.960
<b>Oh, you can see the Holy Tree from here!</b>

01:57.380 --> 01:59.580
<b>All right, let's do th-</b>

02:00.380 --> 02:02.170
<b>Yeow oww ouch...</b>

02:03.290 --> 02:06.830
<b>And so, that's how our 
team retreat started out.</b>

02:07.210 --> 02:09.130
<b>We're ready to go!</b>

02:11.960 --> 02:13.170
<b>Hoshimori.</b>

02:13.170 --> 02:16.330
<b>Donning their celestial suits with
the power of the Holy Tree,</b>

02:16.330 --> 02:21.170
<b>they stand as humanity's only hope
against the mysterious Irous invaders.</b>

02:21.920 --> 02:27.040
<b>And this, this is the story of both
their battles and their comradery.</b>

02:30.960 --> 02:37.000
<b>Ima meippai no hoshizora ni 
yume no seiza o mitsukeyou</b>

02:37.000 --> 02:45.420
<b>Kokoro o tsunaidara itsuka kanaeru yo</b>

02:53.710 --> 02:58.670
<b>Hashiridasu junbi wa dekita ka na</b>

02:59.130 --> 03:04.210
<b>Nagai michi demo nakama ga iru kara</b>

03:04.630 --> 03:08.960
<b>Fuange na kao shite mayou yori</b>

03:08.960 --> 03:13.880
<b>Tobikonde waraou</b>

03:14.460 --> 03:19.920
<b>Surechigai de kousa shita heart mo</b>

03:19.920 --> 03:22.630
<b>Kizuna e to kawaru desho</b>

03:22.630 --> 03:29.750
<b>Kasanetara hitotsu ni shite 
mirai o tsukamu chikara ni</b>

03:30.420 --> 03:36.250
<b>Ima meippai no hoshizora 
e yume o zutto oikakete</b>

03:36.250 --> 03:41.670
<b>Nobashita tenohira wa 
akiramenai omoi o kureru</b>

03:41.670 --> 03:47.170
<b>Nanbyaku kai no chousen mo 
hitori nanka ja nai kara</b>

03:47.170 --> 03:54.210
<b>Daijoubu kao o agete kitto starry sky</b>

03:54.210 --> 03:57.040
<b>Kanaeru yo</b>

03:59.080 --> 04:04.040
<b>Episode 2
Is That What Gets You?</b>

04:07.710 --> 04:08.960
<b>Hoshimori...</b>

04:08.960 --> 04:13.710
<b>A team of young girls garbed in celestial suits
made by the power of the Holy Tree.</b>

04:14.380 --> 04:17.670
<b>Since long ago, the Hoshimori have
pushed back against the miasma,</b>

04:17.670 --> 04:21.920
<b>fighting off the alien Irous invaders,
and putting a stop to them.</b>

04:22.290 --> 04:29.330
<b>But one day, an onslaught of Irous on a scale
never seen before descended in an all-out invasion.</b>

04:30.000 --> 04:35.540
<b>Try as they might, the Hoshimori could not win,
and Earth itself fell to the Irous.</b>

04:36.170 --> 04:41.630
<b>Left with no other choice, humankind headed for
the Colony protected by the Holy Tree.</b>

04:41.630 --> 04:45.210
<b>Now, five years after this 
so-called "Judgment Day"...</b>

04:49.540 --> 04:54.040
<b>Here on the colony watched over by the Holy Tree,
a new Hoshimori team,</b>

04:54.040 --> 04:58.750
<b>made up of Miki Hoshitsuki and friends,
ventured forth to recapture planet Earth.</b>

05:03.250 --> 05:09.790
<b>By returning the Holy Tree from its orbit back to
the surface, they won the planet back from the Irous.</b>

05:11.080 --> 05:14.920
<b>However, that itself was not 
enough to bring true peace.</b>

05:15.380 --> 05:19.500
<b>To this very day the Irous continue to
threaten the peace of humankind.</b>

05:19.500 --> 05:25.500
<b>Their battle never-ending, the Hoshimori team
and their new teammates don their celestial suits,</b>

05:25.500 --> 05:27.920
<b>and fight to save the people of Earth!</b>

05:30.420 --> 05:35.460
<b>That was an introductory video we show
to all new Hoshimori recruits.</b>

05:35.460 --> 05:37.960
<b>But none of that should 
have really been news.</b>

05:37.960 --> 05:39.750
<b>Was it a bit boring?</b>

05:39.750 --> 05:42.580
<b>No, it was most intriguing.</b>

05:45.080 --> 05:46.170
<b>Hah!</b>

05:47.130 --> 05:48.250
<b>Hiyah!</b>

05:48.250 --> 05:49.420
<b>Boom!</b>

05:52.000 --> 05:54.210
<b>Okay! Who's next?</b>

05:54.210 --> 05:57.380
<b>Hinata! We need to stick together!</b>

05:57.630 --> 06:00.460
<b>Look at that! Hinata is on a roll!</b>

06:00.460 --> 06:02.460
<b>We've been at this for three days already.</b>

06:02.460 --> 06:04.460
<b>Looks like we're seeing its effects.</b>

06:04.460 --> 06:06.920
<b>She's been working so hard 
after class, after all.</b>

06:06.920 --> 06:09.130
<b>But look at how she just runs off...</b>

06:09.130 --> 06:11.130
<b>The two aren't working in combination.</b>

06:11.130 --> 06:12.210
<b>Really?</b>

06:12.210 --> 06:13.540
<b>Wh-what?</b>

06:13.670 --> 06:17.960
<b>Well, I just never imagined you of all people
would complain about anyone running off alone.</b>

06:18.460 --> 06:20.580
<b>Why? I only do so after careful assessment!</b>

06:20.580 --> 06:23.500
<b>Oh? Well, what about last time when...</b>

06:23.500 --> 06:24.670
<b>Sniff sniff...</b>

06:25.580 --> 06:27.830
<b>Do I smell a fight?</b>

06:27.830 --> 06:31.080
<b>N-no! Nozomi's just making stuff up!</b>

06:32.000 --> 06:34.580
<b>Yuri's just being so mean to me!</b>

06:35.130 --> 06:36.580
<b>How cute!
Wha-!? Nozomi!</b>

06:36.580 --> 06:39.000
<b>You two! We're in the 
middle of a battle here.</b>

06:39.000 --> 06:40.290
<b>Super sorry!</b>

06:40.500 --> 06:44.130
<b>Yeah, but, these Irous don't 
really seem like a big deal.</b>

06:44.130 --> 06:45.830
<b>Should be a piece of cake.</b>

06:45.830 --> 06:47.250
<b>We can only hope...</b>

06:51.040 --> 06:52.130
<b>Everyone's...</b>

06:56.040 --> 06:56.880
<b>Sadone!</b>

06:56.880 --> 06:58.630
<b>Sadone! Are you all right?</b>

06:58.630 --> 06:59.880
<b>Answer me!</b>

07:17.960 --> 07:19.380
<b>H-hey...</b>

07:20.040 --> 07:21.170
<b>Thank you...</b>

07:32.670 --> 07:35.500
<b>Junior High Grade One team 
reporting back from duty!</b>

07:35.500 --> 07:37.330
<b>Good job, all of you.</b>

07:37.630 --> 07:39.670
<b>Sadone, make sure you head to
the med bay just in case.</b>

07:39.670 --> 07:40.750
<b>Okay...</b>

07:41.670 --> 07:42.830
<b>Oh, Misaki.</b>

07:44.670 --> 07:47.170
<b>Thanks for saving Sadone out there.</b>

07:47.710 --> 07:49.880
<b>All I did was take down the Irous.</b>

07:49.880 --> 07:52.460
<b>Still though, you're super strong!</b>

07:52.460 --> 07:54.250
<b>You took me by surprise!</b>

07:55.750 --> 07:57.170
<b>Now hold up.</b>

07:57.420 --> 07:58.580
<b>Oh, Yuri?</b>

07:58.580 --> 08:01.830
<b>We have set schedules to decide
who goes out to battle.</b>

08:01.830 --> 08:04.210
<b>Now that you've gone and 
completely ignored that,</b>

08:04.210 --> 08:06.960
<b>you're gonna have to answer to
the head of the school disciplinary committee!</b>

08:06.960 --> 08:09.580
<b>I'm not exactly sure you 
have that sort of power...</b>

08:09.710 --> 08:13.420
<b>I just couldn't stand watching her struggle
against such a weak enemy.</b>

08:13.420 --> 08:14.630
<b>Say that again!</b>

08:14.630 --> 08:15.670
<b>M-Misaki...</b>

08:15.670 --> 08:16.920
<b>Let her be, Yuri.</b>

08:17.460 --> 08:18.330
<b>But...</b>

08:18.330 --> 08:21.880
<b>She's only just joined up with us.</b>

08:22.420 --> 08:25.250
<b>Let's give her a little leeway, shall we?</b>

08:25.830 --> 08:31.500
<b>Now, in order to get you used to things around here,
we're gonna have you join our little retreat.</b>

08:31.920 --> 08:33.500
<b>As for your room...</b>

08:33.500 --> 08:36.130
<b>There are only two girls in the junior high
third year room, so how about there?</b>

08:36.130 --> 08:37.040
<b>Wha-?!</b>

08:37.040 --> 08:38.540
<b>She's in your hands, Ms. Asahina.</b>

08:38.540 --> 08:39.580
<b>R-right!</b>

08:39.580 --> 08:40.330
<b>Wha-?!</b>

08:40.500 --> 08:43.380
<b>Sweet! Now Misaki's finally with us!</b>

08:43.380 --> 08:47.330
<b>I'll take good care of her too. V-E-R-Y good.</b>

08:48.080 --> 08:50.540
<b>Misaki is so cool!</b>

08:48.080 --> 08:50.830
<b>JH 1st Year Team</b>

08:51.040 --> 08:52.130
<b>Fwoosh!</b>

08:52.130 --> 08:53.290
<b>Swish!</b>

08:53.290 --> 08:56.130
<b>BAM! And then she's done!</b>

08:56.130 --> 08:58.880
<b>Yes, she's quite skilled indeed.</b>

08:59.330 --> 09:01.630
<b>We gotta try and be like that, too!</b>

09:03.000 --> 09:05.500
<b>Y-yeah. Right...</b>

09:06.130 --> 09:09.460
<b>Now then, I think it's about time for a bath.</b>

09:09.460 --> 09:10.790
<b>Me too!</b>

09:15.290 --> 09:18.710
<b>Are you worried about our rowdy new girly?</b>

09:18.710 --> 09:20.500
<b>Not exactly, but...</b>

09:20.960 --> 09:23.290
<b>if we're going to work as a team,</b>

09:23.290 --> 09:26.080
<b>we need to have everyone
be able to cooperate like one.</b>

09:26.380 --> 09:28.290
<b>Cooperation, indeed.</b>

09:28.290 --> 09:32.210
<b>Still, she's really something 
we've never seen before!</b>

09:32.210 --> 09:34.830
<b>Here I come!</b>

09:38.380 --> 09:40.080
<b>Jeez, Hinata! Be more careful!</b>

09:40.080 --> 09:41.670
<b>Oh, heh, sorry!</b>

09:41.960 --> 09:45.080
<b>Oh Hinata! Want me to wash you up today?</b>

09:45.080 --> 09:49.330
<b>What? No, you're always 
so tickly when you do it!</b>

09:49.330 --> 09:51.290
<b>Now, now, don't be that way!</b>

09:51.290 --> 09:53.210
<b>I swear I won't this time!</b>

09:53.670 --> 09:55.000
<b>Let up, Renge!</b>

09:55.170 --> 09:58.130
<b>My, my, what a ruckus.</b>

09:58.130 --> 09:59.710
<b>Indeed.</b>

10:02.290 --> 10:04.830
<b>Nothing in this database either, hmm...</b>

10:07.960 --> 10:12.380
<b>All we know is that her name is Misaki
and she's 16 years old.</b>

10:12.380 --> 10:16.040
<b>Are you sure you want a girl like that
on the team, Ms. President?</b>

10:16.040 --> 10:19.080
<b>Well, she was chosen by the Holy Tree.</b>

10:19.080 --> 10:20.290
<b>But still...</b>

10:20.290 --> 10:22.420
<b>The rest I leave in your hands.</b>

10:30.420 --> 10:32.130
<b>Cooking</b>

10:32.290 --> 10:35.540
<b>If you get lost, just 
raise your hand and ask.</b>

10:37.290 --> 10:38.210
<b>Hey you!</b>

10:38.210 --> 10:40.500
<b>Let's save that for after class, shall we?</b>

10:40.500 --> 10:42.330
<b>S-sorry!</b>

10:42.330 --> 10:44.250
<b>What are you doing, Miki?</b>

10:45.130 --> 10:46.420
<b>That's a secret!</b>

10:57.130 --> 11:00.040
<b>If you have something on your mind,
just spit it out, already.</b>

11:00.040 --> 11:03.130
<b>Oh, uhm, thanks for yesterday.</b>

11:03.540 --> 11:05.540
<b>And sorry I...</b>

11:05.540 --> 11:09.670
<b>Just because I couldn't handle it...</b>

11:10.500 --> 11:14.170
<b>If you truly think that, then you should
stay off the battlefield from now on.</b>

11:14.580 --> 11:16.540
<b>You'll only hold everyone back.</b>

11:18.580 --> 11:20.000
<b>Now listen, you!</b>

11:20.000 --> 11:22.380
<b>You think you can just go and 
run your mouth like that?</b>

11:22.380 --> 11:23.670
<b>How dare you say something like that to her!</b>

11:23.670 --> 11:24.330
<b>Kaede, enough!
How dare you say something like that to her!</b>

11:24.330 --> 11:25.080
<b>Kaede, enough!</b>

11:25.880 --> 11:29.920
<b>It's all my fault. So just...</b>

11:29.920 --> 11:30.830
<b>But still!</b>

11:34.000 --> 11:35.330
<b>Hold it right there!</b>

11:35.330 --> 11:37.630
<b>I'm not finished here!</b>

11:39.380 --> 11:41.500
<b>What is with her?!</b>

11:44.080 --> 11:48.040
<b>Subaru Wakaba (1st Year HS)
Birthday: May 4th
Sign: Taurus
Blood Type: A
Measurements: 78/57/78
Height: 157cm
Weight: 45kg
Hobby: Checking out cute clothes
Favorite food: Macarons
Dislikes: Vinegared foods
Dream job: Teacher</b>

11:48.130 --> 11:52.080
<b>Asuha Kusunoki (3rd Year HS)
Birthday: January 18th
Sign: Capricorn
Blood Type: A
Measurements: 85/55/86
Height: 163cm
Weight: 51kg
Hobby: Meditation
Dream job: Tea Ceremony or Calligraphy Instructor
Favorite food: Soba
Dislikes: Western cuisine</b>

11:54.080 --> 11:56.080
<b>What? A welcome party?!</b>

11:56.080 --> 11:56.790
<b>Yup!</b>

11:56.080 --> 11:58.790
<b>Closed for cleaning
DO NOT ENTER</b>

11:56.790 --> 11:58.540
<b>Woopie! A party!</b>

11:58.920 --> 12:02.080
<b>Misaki still doesn't really 
know us well, right?</b>

12:02.080 --> 12:06.920
<b>So I was thinking if we all had a fun party together
we might be able to get along.</b>

12:04.420 --> 12:06.920
<b>Misaki's Welcome
Party Meeting</b>

12:06.920 --> 12:09.630
<b>I must say I'm not a fan.</b>

12:10.080 --> 12:12.460
<b>Now, now, Kaede!</b>

12:12.460 --> 12:13.960
<b>Wha-? Renge?</b>

12:13.960 --> 12:16.630
<b>We've finally got someone new!</b>

12:17.920 --> 12:21.130
<b>Okay, okay! I get it, just stop!
I for one would love to welcome her.</b>

12:21.290 --> 12:22.670
<b>I like the idea.</b>

12:22.670 --> 12:24.040
<b>Me too!</b>

12:24.040 --> 12:27.960
<b>Forget the circumstances, 
she's one of us now.</b>

12:27.960 --> 12:29.250
<b>Right, Yuri?</b>

12:29.250 --> 12:30.460
<b>Y-yeah.</b>

12:30.750 --> 12:32.460
<b>Is everyone else okay with this?</b>

12:32.460 --> 12:33.630
<b>Yup!</b>

12:34.250 --> 12:37.960
<b>Okay, if we're gonna do 
this, let's go all out!</b>

12:37.960 --> 12:39.330
<b>Yeah!</b>

12:41.750 --> 12:43.750
<b>Time to draw roles for the party, then!</b>

12:42.420 --> 12:43.420
<b>Role
Lottery</b>

12:43.750 --> 12:46.330
<b>You get what you get, no complaints, okay?</b>

12:46.880 --> 12:48.250
<b>Entertainment</b>

12:48.380 --> 12:50.960
<b>Entertain... ment...</b>

12:51.290 --> 12:53.330
<b>Oh! You're with me!</b>

12:53.330 --> 12:55.210
<b>Time for some teamwork, Azucchi!</b>

12:55.210 --> 12:56.630
<b>Y-yeah...</b>

12:56.790 --> 12:59.210
<b>Looks like we're in charge of decorations.</b>

12:59.210 --> 13:00.880
<b>We'll make a great team.</b>

13:00.880 --> 13:01.920
<b>Oh yeah!</b>

13:01.920 --> 13:04.540
<b>We're in charge of the food.</b>

13:04.540 --> 13:06.380
<b>Oh! Me too!</b>

13:05.540 --> 13:06.460
<b>Cooking</b>

13:08.420 --> 13:10.880
<b>Misaki's Welcome Party
List of Roles
Cooking
JH 2nd years     HS 1st years
Decorations
JH 1st years     HS 2nd years 
Entertainment
JH 3rd years     HS 3rd years</b>

13:11.000 --> 13:11.830
<b>What?</b>

13:12.580 --> 13:15.420
<b>I hope everyone's ready for this!</b>

13:16.210 --> 13:22.880
<b>Your future super star idol Urara is gonna
steal away your hearts with her song and dance!</b>

13:22.880 --> 13:24.710
<b>Hey, Urara...</b>

13:24.710 --> 13:27.750
<b>do you really need me for this?</b>

13:28.170 --> 13:29.630
<b>Of course!</b>

13:29.630 --> 13:32.960
<b>C'mon now, we're gonna spend the whole night
perfecting our choreography!</b>

13:32.960 --> 13:35.630
<b>What? All night?</b>

13:37.420 --> 13:39.630
<b>Welcome Party Script
TOP SECRET</b>

13:37.420 --> 13:40.540
<b>W-we're really going to do this?</b>

13:41.000 --> 13:45.000
<b>I'll tell you, it took a lot of work
writing that in one night.</b>

13:45.000 --> 13:50.960
<b>You don't want those underclassmen
seeing you in a bad light, right?</b>

13:50.960 --> 13:53.130
<b>Sure, but...</b>

13:53.630 --> 13:55.380
<b>The party is tonight.</b>

13:55.380 --> 13:57.630
<b>We don't have much time, 
so let's get practicing!</b>

13:57.960 --> 14:00.670
<b>Just... go easy on me...</b>

14:04.500 --> 14:05.500
<b>Hmm?</b>

14:05.500 --> 14:08.670
<b>Wh-what? Something wrong?</b>

14:09.000 --> 14:11.290
<b>Nope! You look adorable!</b>

14:11.290 --> 14:12.790
<b>Wha-?! Ador-</b>

14:12.790 --> 14:13.630
<b>Yup!</b>

14:14.710 --> 14:16.580
<b>You can do it, Kaede!</b>

14:16.580 --> 14:18.330
<b>You know it!</b>

14:18.330 --> 14:19.830
<b>I'm me, after all...</b>

14:19.830 --> 14:21.330
<b>What's one little potato!</b>

14:25.330 --> 14:27.540
<b>Okay girls, cookies are done!</b>

14:27.790 --> 14:29.920
<b>C'mon, give them a taste!</b>

14:34.920 --> 14:36.750
<b>They're delicious, Miki!</b>

14:37.210 --> 14:38.420
<b>Oh, thanks!</b>

14:39.630 --> 14:42.630
<b>Welcome to the Hoshimori Class
Misaki</b>

14:39.630 --> 14:42.630
<b>Then it's just like this, and there!</b>

14:44.540 --> 14:46.710
<b>Wow, nice, Sakura!</b>

14:46.710 --> 14:49.630
<b>Well, when you get to be my age...</b>

14:49.630 --> 14:51.920
<b>You just started junior high.</b>

14:51.920 --> 14:53.130
<b>Sniff, sniff.</b>

14:53.130 --> 14:57.330
<b>Kurumi, that's not real,
so it doesn't actually smell like a flower.</b>

14:57.670 --> 15:01.790
<b>Maybe... But it still smells ever so nice.</b>

15:06.790 --> 15:10.750
<b>Welcome to the Hoshimori Class
Misaki</b>

15:18.500 --> 15:22.250
<b>Welcome to the Hoshimori Class, Misaki!</b>

15:22.380 --> 15:24.080
<b>Welcome to the Hoshimori Class
Misaki</b>

15:28.920 --> 15:31.000
<b>What exactly are you trying to-</b>

15:32.880 --> 15:37.210
<b>Alrighty, now that our star guest is here,
let's get this party started!</b>

15:39.040 --> 15:43.540
<b>First up we have future
super star idols Urara and Kokomi!</b>

15:44.920 --> 15:45.880
<b>Yay!</b>

16:20.420 --> 16:24.630
<b>Okay! Now that things are rolling,
it's time for our next act!</b>

16:24.630 --> 16:25.580
<b>C'mon out!</b>

16:25.580 --> 16:27.290
<b>Hello!</b>

16:27.880 --> 16:29.330
<b>It's time for Ren-ren...</b>

16:29.330 --> 16:31.290
<b>And uhh, Azu-azu's...</b>

16:31.290 --> 16:34.500
<b>Super-hot short skits!</b>

16:34.500 --> 16:36.790
<b>First! "Sick Day"!</b>

16:38.040 --> 16:41.330
<b>I feel awful! Super sick!</b>

16:41.330 --> 16:43.460
<b>Oh? Wh-what is the matter?</b>

16:43.460 --> 16:46.540
<b>Oh, Miss Captain, I feel pretty sick.</b>

16:46.540 --> 16:48.670
<b>W-well, we cannot have that.</b>

16:48.670 --> 16:51.250
<b>We need healthy bodies to be in Hoshimori.</b>

16:51.250 --> 16:54.210
<b>You sure seem in good health, Miss Captain.</b>

16:54.210 --> 16:55.040
<b>Oh, yes.</b>

16:55.630 --> 16:58.210
<b>Your "Miss Captain" will 
never MISS being CAPTAIN!</b>

17:10.460 --> 17:12.460
<b>What's the matter, Misaki?</b>

17:21.630 --> 17:23.750
<b>Girls! We've got Irous!</b>

17:24.830 --> 17:28.540
<b>This time we seem to have detected
one unidentified Irous.</b>

17:29.330 --> 17:31.920
<b>You mean, like some new breed or something?</b>

17:31.920 --> 17:32.920
<b>Exactly.</b>

17:33.170 --> 17:35.330
<b>Today's team is...</b>

17:35.330 --> 17:37.170
<b>Here! It's us!</b>

17:37.540 --> 17:39.210
<b>High school first years, was it?</b>

17:39.210 --> 17:41.790
<b>Seeing as how we have
a new type of Irous on our hands,</b>

17:41.790 --> 17:45.750
<b>I want to be prepared, and send out
another team with you, but...</b>

17:46.670 --> 17:49.290
<b>We'll take care of that for you.</b>

17:49.290 --> 17:51.880
<b>Kanon! And Shiho too!</b>

17:51.880 --> 17:55.750
<b>Sorry. Work held us up and 
we couldn't make the party.</b>

17:55.750 --> 18:00.000
<b>I know this doesn't quite make up for it,
but leave this one to us.</b>

18:00.670 --> 18:02.420
<b>You've got it!</b>

18:07.250 --> 18:09.500
<b>Teleportation coordinates acquired.</b>

18:09.500 --> 18:10.580
<b>Initiating transmission!</b>

18:47.630 --> 18:50.380
<b>So the Hoshimori girls are finally here.</b>

18:50.580 --> 18:54.580
<b>Now just how will they entertain me tonight?</b>

19:07.170 --> 19:08.670
<b>Was that the last of them?</b>

19:08.670 --> 19:09.580
<b>It was.</b>

19:09.580 --> 19:10.790
<b>Look out!</b>

19:19.500 --> 19:20.920
<b>What was that?</b>

19:20.920 --> 19:23.130
<b>That must be the new Irous...</b>

19:35.960 --> 19:37.540
<b>You wanna play ball?</b>

19:37.540 --> 19:39.000
<b>Then I'm your girl!</b>

19:41.710 --> 19:42.710
<b>Subaru!</b>

19:44.540 --> 19:45.540
<b>Thanks!</b>

19:50.500 --> 19:52.170
<b>This one's a toughie.</b>

19:52.170 --> 19:53.670
<b>Let's all team up for an attack.</b>

19:53.670 --> 19:54.540
<b>Got it!</b>

20:05.630 --> 20:06.750
<b>No way!</b>

20:19.420 --> 20:20.710
<b>Misaki?</b>

20:20.880 --> 20:22.500
<b>Her again?!</b>

20:38.960 --> 20:41.540
<b>Oh? And who do we have here?</b>

20:45.920 --> 20:46.960
<b>Misaki!</b>

20:54.540 --> 20:55.790
<b>Nice!</b>

20:55.790 --> 20:57.630
<b>Misaki is amazing!</b>

20:57.630 --> 20:59.330
<b>She's really something.</b>

21:00.250 --> 21:02.130
<b>She's definitely strong...</b>

21:02.130 --> 21:03.130
<b>But...</b>

21:03.130 --> 21:06.920
<b>it's almost like she knew 
how to defeat it all along.</b>

21:08.580 --> 21:09.960
<b>Misaki!</b>

21:12.040 --> 21:13.040
<b>That was amazing!</b>

21:13.040 --> 21:14.500
<b>You're amazing, Misaki!</b>

21:19.250 --> 21:20.460
<b>No, I'm not.</b>

21:20.880 --> 21:21.750
<b>Wha-?</b>

21:24.920 --> 21:27.790
<b>This just wasn't enough...</b>

21:32.460 --> 21:34.540
<b>Well, let it be.</b>

21:34.540 --> 21:38.000
<b>No matter who she is, none 
will stand in my way.</b>

21:48.250 --> 21:51.500
<b>Sadone! Let's save the cleanup for tomorrow.</b>

21:51.500 --> 21:52.750
<b>Y-yeah.</b>

22:12.460 --> 22:18.920
<b>Mawatteru hazu demo tomatteru ki ga shite</b>

22:18.920 --> 22:25.250
<b>Hitori de nayande wakatteru furi</b>

22:25.250 --> 22:31.670
<b>Meimetsu no hate ni tozakaru risou o</b>

22:31.670 --> 22:37.460
<b>Hitomi ni utsushite hashiraseta noise</b>

22:37.460 --> 22:44.000
<b>Kodoku na rondeau ni torawareru ishi</b>

22:44.250 --> 22:47.670
<b>Kazashitara nukedashite</b>

22:47.670 --> 22:53.040
<b>Tomoni kanademashou saa</b>

22:53.170 --> 23:00.000
<b>Dare demo nai kimeru no 
wa jibun jishin dakara</b>

23:00.000 --> 23:06.170
<b>Seikai mo machigai mo "rashisa" ni kawatteku</b>

23:06.170 --> 23:12.960
<b>Kasanariai itsu no hi ka kanau to shinjitara</b>

23:12.960 --> 23:21.790
<b>Shiroi fumen kakidasu kono 
yo ni hitotsu dake no</b>

23:22.040 --> 23:25.040
<b>Ring out melody</b>

23:26.380 --> 23:29.670
<b>Southern isles, blue seas, white beaches!</b>

23:30.500 --> 23:34.380
<b>This must be a present for 
how hard we've worked!</b>

23:34.380 --> 23:37.500
<b>Next time: "Resort x Retreat x Escape?"</b>

23:36.040 --> 23:41.040
<b>Next Episode
Resort x Retreat x Escape?
Leave it to me! Woof!</b>

23:37.500 --> 23:40.710
<b>Wait, this isn't the sort 
of vacation I had in mind!</b>
